# Enterprise-side input contract for enterprise-operating-model-pack. Shipped EMPTY.
#
# A consumer supplies Turtle only. Content goes here (or overlays this path):
#   - an ea:Strategy carrying eom:ofEnterprise;
#   - an eom:OperatingModelDecision (axes, chosen model, targetClosure, targetBaseIri);
#   - the foundation elements, whose eom:supportsCapability links point at industry
#     capabilities that carry ic:capabilityKey;
#   - the engagement model and ADM phase records;
#   - existing ABBs in ea: shape, so skeletons appear only where none exist.
#
# Prefixes eom:, ea:, ic:, skos:, dcterms:, org: and togaf: are declared by the
# consumer file that needs them. This contract deliberately declares no triples.

@prefix eom: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/enterprise-operating-model-pack#> .
